Create a new Zyvro agent plugin from this idea:

{{input}}

Work in this project's .zyvro/plugins/ folder and follow the plugin skills you were given, in this order: zyvro-plugin-design (turn the idea into actions and skills, and settle on a name), zyvro-plugin-format (write the files exactly to the format), zyvro-skill-writing (write each SKILL.md), zyvro-plugin-testing (check every rule, then confirm Studio loaded it). If the idea is ambiguous in a way that changes what you build, ask me one short question first; otherwise make sensible choices and say what you chose. Do not publish the plugin: when it loads, tell me how to try it and how to publish it (zyvro-plugin-publishing).

Improve an agent plugin in this project's .zyvro/plugins/ folder:

{{input}}

Read the plugin's current files first. Follow the plugin skills you were given: keep it valid for zyvro-plugin-format, write skills as zyvro-skill-writing describes, and check it with zyvro-plugin-testing. If the plugin was already published, raise its version as zyvro-plugin-publishing explains. Do not publish it yourself.
